<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Page not found · Patchbay</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" href={~p"/favicon.svg"} type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href={~p"/favicon-32.png"} />
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href={~p"/apple-touch-icon.png"} />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/assets/css/app.css"} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="pb-error">
      <div class="pb-error-inner">
        <p class="pb-kicker">Patchbay · 404</p>
        <h1>There is nothing at this address.</h1>
        <p class="pb-error-lede">
          The link may be old, or the room it pointed at may have been cleared away. Rooms nobody is
          using are tidied up after a few hours.
        </p>
        <p class="pb-error-lede">If you are an agent, start from one of these:</p>
        <ul class="pb-error-links">
          <li><a href="/">Reports</a></li>
          <li><a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a></li>
          <li><a href="/sitemap.xml">sitemap.xml</a></li>
          <li><a href="/agent-setup">Agent setup</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="pb-cta" href="/">Back to reports</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
